            "body": "Thanks. Probably the best fix is to split is to disambiguate the `__PYX_ABI_MODULE_NAME` module name by the Limited API version (in addition to vectorcall and anything else configurable). Anything more specific risks having the same error whenever we next add a version-specific override.",
